 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Because I'm Super Lucky, I Got a Second Chance at Life"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Chou Koun no Oredake Jinsei Kaiki"
   },
   {
    "ja": "超幸運の俺だけ人生回帰"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yukito Takahashi, a G-rank adventurer, has spent decades being mocked as useless because no matter how much he leveled up, his stats never improved. Even as he grew older, he dreamed of being young again and stronger, but he died during an adventure without ever getting better.\n\nHowever, after his death, something unbelievable happened—a mysterious message appeared:\n\"A critical bug in the status system has been found. Your life will be rolled back.\"\n\nWith that, Yukito was sent back to his younger self, but this time, all his stats were maxed out at 9999! Now with godlike powers, Yukito can live the life he always dreamed of.\n\nThis is not your typical story of an unlucky protagonist—it's a tale of ultimate luck and overwhelming power! Get ready for a thrilling adventure where luck changes everything!"
  },
